{"title":"2011 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/0/7509af8adc986fec40af8f94de5dabd1c0842be6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b = 9 - c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/8/4281ee6af4b98cc6980b8da3107c1242d6d6cdf2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b = 5 + c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/0/7509af8adc986fec40af8f94de5dabd1c0842be6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b = 9 - c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/8/4281ee6af4b98cc6980b8da3107c1242d6d6cdf2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b = 5 + c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/7/c47882c4802cfc8dd7e04bacccdca0e37d773006.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 - c = 5 + c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"15\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/5/ef507ebf0d955997d5d4e21bd8ab9417fd2e3cd0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 - 5 = c + c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/2/3d2ff1f12b00febfada88d6dec1ec436aa88fada.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2c = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/7/8e7d4db1ab068a6febfdcb6a0420491871de500a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = \\frac{4}{2} = \\boxed{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"92\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Summing the equations, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/1/c81ad752da490269d8dc044ad3030c65bcf47c46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b + a + b = 9 - c + 5 + c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"228\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/2/ab2a50ca927315f2584e374d1ffefb502552888c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(a + b) = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"107\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/5/d05b88e5ba9e01b418209ac270a344815cd67b03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b = \\frac{14}{2} = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"121\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Plugging this into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/8/4281ee6af4b98cc6980b8da3107c1242d6d6cdf2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b = 5 + c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/e/ebe5b8038c05ae285b232f8d2ac6ccc5e2eb15dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 = 5 + c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/8/de893a8d37c52112a5dc1e3cfe15566867cfe472.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 7 - 5 = \\boxed{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"119\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CIMC\" title=\"2011 CIMC\">2011 CIMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CIMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 CIMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CIMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 CIMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2011 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2011 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2011 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2011 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2011 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Intermediate_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Intermediate Competition\">CEMC Intermediate Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018054730\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.020 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.028 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 126/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1289/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 140/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2784/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.0